*   **cabin\_noise\_rating**: Praised for a well-insulated cabin (Source [21]). Score: 0.50.
*   **shift\_smooth\_rating**: 9G-Tronic is generally smooth (Source [8, 38]). Score: 0.50.
*   **steering\_feel\_rating**: Reviews mention a lack of steering feel despite being precise (Source [5, 7]). Score: -0.50.
*   **adas\_score**: Offers a wide range of modern ADAS features, especially with optional packages (Source [1, 4, 7, 24]). Score: 0.60.
*   **visibility\_rating**: Standard sedan visibility, reviews don't highlight major issues (Source [2]). Score: 0.00.
*   **headlight\_rating**: LED High Performance standard, Digital Light optional (Source [3, 17]). Good standard, excellent optional. Score: 0.40.
*   **security\_rating**: Offers advanced security features like fingerprint scanner and Urban Guard package (Source [7, 23]). Score: 0.60.
*   **screen\_in**: Large central touchscreen, 11.9 inches standard/optional (Source [1, 4, 7, 16, 17, 18, 23]). Score: 0.80.
*   **infotainment\_ux\_rating**: Latest MBUX system, generally well-regarded but some find touch controls fiddly (Source [1, 3, 4, 5, 7, 18, 23, 38]). Score: 0.60.
*   **smartphone\_connect\_rating**: Wireless Apple CarPlay and Android Auto standard (Source [1, 3, 4, 7, 18, 23]). Score: 1.00.
*   **audio\_rating**: Optional Burmester system is excellent (Source [1, 4, 21, 38]). Standard system is likely average. Score: 0.40.
*   **usb\_ports**: Offers multiple USB-C ports (Source [1]). Score: 0.60.
*   **comfort\_feature\_score**: Heated front seats standard, power seats with memory, dual-zone climate, ambient lighting (Source [1, 4, 7, 30, 38]). Good level of comfort features. Score: 0.60.
*   **convenience\_feature\_score**: 360-degree camera, self-parking, wireless charging, fingerprint sensor, keyless entry (Source [1, 4, 7, 23]). Good convenience features. Score: 0.60.
*   **brand\_prestige\_rating**: Mercedes-Benz is a high-prestige brand. Score: 0.80.
*   **model\_prestige\_rating**: C-Class is a core, mid-range model for Mercedes-Benz. Score: 0.00.
*   **trim\_prestige\_rating**: AMG Line is a desirable appearance/sport package, but not the top performance trim. Score: 0.00.
*   **interior\_luxury\_rating**: High-quality materials, S-Class inspired design, ambient lighting (Source [1, 2, 5, 7, 16, 18, 38]). Some reviews note mixed material quality in lower areas (Source [1, 3, 5]). Score: 0.70.
*   **interior\_tech\_focus\_rating**: Dominated by large screens, heavy reliance on touch controls, fingerprint scanner (Source [1, 4, 5, 7, 16, 17, 18, 23, 38]). High tech focus. Score: 0.90.

